uits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},{"name":"base","value_wikitext":"[[Athens, Greece]]","value_text":"Athens, Greece","links":[{"target_title":"Athens, Greece","label":"Athens, Greece","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Athens%2C_Greece","status":"unresolved"}]},{"name":"gender","value_wikitext":"Male","value_text":"Male","links":[]},{"name":"hair","value_wikitext":"Bald","value_text":"Bald","links":[]},{"name":"eyes","value_wikitext":"Brown, red","value_text":"Brown, red","links":[]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"[[OAL-061]]","value_text":"OAL-061","links":[{"target_title":"OAL-061","label":"OAL-061","target_id":"huntik:page:12211","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/OAL-061","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12211"}]}],"start":0,"end":224}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Abdul is one of the agents stationed in [[Athens, Greece]]. {{source|OAL-061}}\n\nOn one occasion, whilst working under [[Rassimov]], Abdul held off enemy attacks to give his commander time to escape through secret passage. {{Source|OAL-100}}\n\nHe was once rescued amidst a sandstorm by his [[Thornment]] Titan. {{Source|TCG:PRO-023|PRO-023}}","text":"Abdul is one of the agents stationed in Athens, Greece. [OAL-061]\n\nOn one occasion, whilst working under Rassimov, Abdul held off enemy attacks to give his commander time to escape through secret passage. [OAL-100]\n\nHe was once rescued amidst a sandstorm by his Thornment Titan. [TCG:PRO-023]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Mr. Abdul appears to possess more powerful abilities and Titans than the regular [[Suits]]. \n{{Col-begin}}{{Col-2}}","text":"Mr. Abdul appears to possess more powerful abilities and Titans than the regular Suits."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Darkwave]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n{{Col-2}}","text":"*Darkwave\n*Raypulse"},{"heading":"Titans Bonded","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Thornment]]\n{{Col-end}}\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:TCG characters]]","text":"*Thornment"}],"full_text":"Mr. Abdul is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by Rassimov.\n\n== History ==\nAbdul is one of the agents stationed in Athens, Greece. [OAL-061]\n\nOn one occasion, whilst working under Rassimov, Abdul held off enemy attacks to give his commander time to escape through secret passage. [OAL-100]\n\nHe was once rescued amidst a sandstorm by his Thornment Titan. [TCG:PRO-023]\n== Abilities ==\nMr. Abdul appears to possess more powerful abilities and Titans than the regular Suits. \n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n*Darkwave\n*Raypulse\n\n=== Titans Bonded ===\n*Thornment","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Mr Abdul profile.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Athens, Greece]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Bald\n| eyes   = Brown, red\n| first  = [[OAL-061]]\n}}'''Mr. Abdul''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[Rassimov]].\n\n== History ==\nAbdul is one of the agents stationed in [[Athens, Greece]]. {{source|OAL-061}}\n\nOn one occasion, whilst working under [[Rassimov]], Abdul held off enemy attacks to give his commander time to escape through secret passage. {{Source|OAL-100}}\n\nHe was once rescued amidst a sandstorm by his [[Thornment]] Titan. {{Source|TCG:PRO-023|PRO-023}}\n== Abilities ==\nMr. Abdul appears to possess more powerful abilities and Titans than the regular [[Suits]]. \n{{Col-begin}}{{Col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n*[[Darkwave]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Titans Bonded ===\n*[[Thornment]]\n{{Col-end}}\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:TCG characters]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits","TCG characters"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Athens, Greece","label":"Athens, Greece","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Athens%2C_Greece","status":"unresolved"},{"target_title":"OAL-061","label":"OAL-061","target_id":"huntik:page:12211","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/OAL-061","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12211"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Athens, Greece","label":"Athens, Greece","target_id":null,"target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Athens%2C_Greece","status":"unresolved"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Thornment","label":"Thornment","target_id":"huntik:page:3306","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Thornment","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3306"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"hu